==Symbols==
===Mascot===
[[File:1986 FIFA World Cup official Mascot.png|thumb|150px|Pique, the official mascot of the 1986 FIFA World Cup]]
The [[FIFA World Cup mascots|official mascot]] of the 1986 World Cup was ''Pique'', a [[jalapeño]] pepper, characteristic of [[Mexican cuisine]], with a moustache, a Colimote [[sombrero]], and Mexican football team colours. Its name comes from ''picante'', a Spanish word meaning "spicy", and was also a pun on the "PK" abbreviation of the football term [[penalty shot|penalty kick]]. Pique is also a common Spanish name.

The character caused a degree of controversy within Mexico for its ethnic stereotypes.<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.nytimes.com/1984/05/12/world/mexico-world-cup-mascot-not-ole-but-oh-no.html|title=MEXICO WORLD CUP MASCOT: NOT 'OLE' BUT 'OH NO'|work=[[The New York Times]]|date=12 May 1984|archive-date=6 December 2022|access-date=6 December 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221206094130/https://www.nytimes.com/1984/05/12/world/mexico-world-cup-mascot-not-ole-but-oh-no.html|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite book|last=Snyder|first=John|title=Soccer's Most Wanted: The Top 10 Book of Clumsy Keepers, Clever Crosses, and Outlandish Oddities|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=_fvyc3QC0TYC&pg=PA247|date=1 September 2001|publisher=Potomac Books, Inc.|isbn=978-1-57488-365-7|page=247}}</ref>

===Match ball===
[[File:Adidas Azteca Mexico 1986 Official ball.jpg|thumb|150px|Adidas Azteca]]
{{Main|Adidas Azteca}}

The [[List of FIFA World Cup official match balls|official match ball]] of this World Cup was the "[[Adidas Azteca|Azteca]]", manufactured by [[Adidas]]. It was the first fully synthetic FIFA World Cup ball and the elaborately decorated design was inspired by the hosting nation’s native [[Aztec architecture]] and murals.<ref>{{Cite news |last= |first= |title=Adidas Azteca is official match ball of World Cup 1986 |website=Football Balls Database |date=2022 |url=http://football-balls.com/ball-details/azteca-official-match-ball-of-world-cup-1986-in-mexico |accessdate=2022-11-22 |archive-date=22 November 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221122121832/http://football-balls.com/ball-details/azteca-official-match-ball-of-world-cup-1986-in-mexico |url-status=live }}</ref>

===Music===
The [[List of FIFA World Cup songs and anthems|official song]] of this World Cup was "[[El mundo unido por un balón]]".

